|---|------|
| **Register** the exact callback URL in the SoundCloud app dashboard. |
| **Use the same URL** when you build the OAuth request (`redirect_uri` param). |
| **Implement a server‑side endpoint** (or server‑less function) that receives `code` and exchanges it for an access token using your `client_secret`. |
| **Store the access token** securely (session, http‑only cookie, or local storage if you’re okay with client‑side storage). |
| **Redirect the user** back to your UI after the token exchange (or send the token in the URL fragment). |
| **Test** both locally (`http://localhost:…`) and in production – both must be whitelisted. |

